<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Unexpected Turns of the Events</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Since this is an alternate universe, there's no Horde invading Etheria. Etheria is not in a pocket dimension, but its in the wider universe.&lt;br /&gt;As of why the Horde ain't invading Etheria? Well lets just say that sapce octopus is engaging in a bit of tomfoolery and keeping them busy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Light Spinner has been exiled from Mystacor after an incident that claimed several lives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Light Spinner however kept in touch with Micah who was to be next head sorcerer of Mystacor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Years go by and Light Spinner comes by an orphan magicat who claims to be last of her kind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Light Spinner takes her in and raises the magicat as her own child.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More years go by and the magicat named Catra has grown up into a teen and Micah has become the new king of Brightmoon and her sister takes place as the new head sorcerer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our story starts here.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>MutsisPP</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Not Rated</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella/Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella/Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Castaspella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
