          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>For the Love of Shadow Weaver Collection (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I Seriously Have No Idea What I Am Doing With This</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Spinner Is In Love But Still In Denial</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Spinner Is Secretly A Softie</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Spinner Has Really Sensitive Ears</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I Regret Nothing Yet At the Same Time Everything</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I Wrote This Instead of Sleeping</rdf:li>
